Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL DARWIN PATCH] gambit: member proofs at the closed link consumer

Apply after 0030 and 0040. Keeps complete ordered CLI binding and all existing
Darwin/explicit-binding admission gates. Member reuse requires an additional
opt-in. Whole-consumer correctness and performance qualification is pending.

